  "title": "The Last Note of Lua Blanco",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Lua Blanco has passed away at 39, leaving a void in the Brazilian music scene.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Lua Blanco (1987–2026)",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Born in São Paulo, she grew up in a large family of musicians and performed from a very young age.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "São Paulo, Brazil",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "The family moved often, including living in Peru for two years during her childhood.",
      "shot": "photo:2",
      "card": {
        "big": "Peru",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "In 2006, she joined the band Lágrima Flor, where she spent five years defining her musical voice.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Lágrima Flor",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything changed in 2011 when she was cast as Roberta Messi in the telenovela Rebelde.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "Rebelde (2011)",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "As the lead singer of Rebeldes, she performed for over 1.2 million spectators across the country.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "1.2 million spectators",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "She was a true artist, becoming the only person to win every category she was nominated for at the Capricho Awards.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "Capricho Awards",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "She leaves behind a legacy of song and stagecraft that will resonate for years.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Her Legacy",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow Orbitwire for the stories the whole world is talking about.",
      "shot": "outro",
      "card": {
        "big": "Orbitwire",
        "small": "Sources in the description"
      },
      "pause_after": 0.5
    }
  ],
